    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "summer_Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "...Yeah?#$e#You're a fine lookin' young man. Why're you wastin' your time talkin' to an old girl like me?^You're a pretty gal. What're you wastin' your time talkin' to someone like me for?",
      "translation": "... Jo?#$e#Jsi pohledný mladý muž. Proč marníš čas tím, že si povídáš se starou ženskou, jako jsem já?^Jsi hezká holka. Proč marníš čas tím, že si povídáš s někým, jako jsem já?",
      "sourceSHA256": "9bd65be9600011ebc2d6ad66edd5377499fbe2173357f0796472ceeeddff2c18",
      "translationSHA256": "5929fde9128c2b1d39cb6ea8f7033005fcaf3363edc92530ba08391a0a1dc489",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "summer_Sat2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Don't mind that ol' dog next to the house.#$b#He might look at you cross, but he'll never get up from that box in a hunderd years.#$b#The old boy's name? It's Dusty.",
      "translation": "Nevšímej si toho starého psa vedle domu.#$b#Možná se na tebe dívá nevraživě, ale ze svého kotce nevyleze ani za sto let.#$b#Jak se ten starouš jmenuje? Dusty.",
      "sourceSHA256": "18d247136091f5fcc9917f44748d6bf636d85febcb2794115e52c4b67e46d06a",
      "translationSHA256": "ad379d582b4f70ed0e8676b53e27ba654ab5a5567518b0988fb4bcbd37e48f48",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "summer_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Someone's been complainin' about my yard... sayin' it's a mess. Was it you?$u#$e#Hmmm...",
      "translation": "Někdo si stěžoval na můj dvorek... Prý je tam nepořádek. Náhodou s tím nemáš něco společného?$u#$e#Hmmm...",
      "sourceSHA256": "3d8f4aabe01fb75b762d954778b2cffbd3e50e55cf34872bc8ef0bc9671f01af",
      "translationSHA256": "3fb44bec1931d039b7a1fc2ced4aac667404910020858e578782c1cb37728bd0",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "fall_Tue",
      "field": null,
      "source": "If I knew you better, I'd be more inclined to chat.",
      "translation": "Kdybych tě znala líp, měla bych větší chuť si povídat.",
      "sourceSHA256": "5ba0c5fb27ed61b5f370109bf540a70607de97953045d50a9641b0b474cee6ba",
      "translationSHA256": "31a6f8a8eef44653e732e2f2b440daaf3870a135d347a86b5656ac8a17b6c9db",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "fall_Tue4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I used to be young, once. Hard to believe, huh?#$e#Time sure goes fast when you grow up.$s",
      "translation": "Kdysi jsem taky byla mladá. Těžko tomu uvěřit, co?#$e#Když člověk stárne, čas vážně letí.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "54dd7c2549a740a00919eb813978ce64febea15643e6e304f8c8195f298e4da5",
      "translationSHA256": "ef9e46fa4fd9d0b540442caf0d498695fb19d71f3fddab1294bb129285b51fe5",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "fall_Wed",
      "field": null,
      "source": "*Sigh*... I guess I'll be popping a frozen dinner into the microwave tonight.$s",
      "translation": "*povzdechne si*... Asi si dnes k večeři hodím do mikrovlnky mražené jídlo.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "9a6977c906a6709bed87618bbd9ca53ca075ed28689e072732927ab632442ee9",
      "translationSHA256": "91eb382fd81806aee0aa105be233f1506bbb57f6fde9d6d2614f3327d92e9b33",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "fall_Thu",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Penny's the only one I've got, so you best treat her kindly.",
      "translation": "Penny je všechno, co mám, tak se k ní radši chovej hezky.",
      "sourceSHA256": "b6040c0f8f75f87102ab08b351a15fe601c6de94de3ad7922d331ccfedf9f8cd",
      "translationSHA256": "f6eb48b958101075a072571ae758218ea30a8ccc87bb7e1bc0dff189bf536a21",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "fall_Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Every day is the same old routine...$s#$e#Do you ever have that problem, farmer?",
      "translation": "Každý den pořád stejná rutina...$s#$e#Míváš na farmě taky tenhle problém?",
      "sourceSHA256": "70f2049ba98a878cf3ab0b73c0631e4994e4dbde0784b75f8f35cad579ea2a9d",
      "translationSHA256": "ffbd73a1d34e341588692c0f84c174ebf6648ede05e1fd730b5e6ac438364776",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "fall_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Would you do me a kindness and clean up my house?#$e#Just kidding.$h",
      "translation": "Neuděláš mi laskavost a neuklidíš mi dům?#$e#Jen si dělám legraci.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "7f47ac3466ec7d1c54cdfdcc1bd2edd6f377c7cef8ad97c77e18bda1cc6fa6f5",
      "translationSHA256": "1735f17b79ad6025ae9f6db7d3286719f1ebeaa9ac7b9aa6fb19c8e48c2156b7",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "fall_Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Don't you have work to do?#$e#You should be thankful that you have a job rather than moping around town all the time.",
      "translation": "Nemáš náhodou nějakou práci?#$e#Važ si toho, že máš práci, místo celodenního lelkování po městě.",
      "sourceSHA256": "70fa5e717943d05ad6bec78c84f78d4f5a018e46354f4eb5162fe021a9845cb9",
      "translationSHA256": "213d9aefe300ac43dc8d18a87a7d986646d84fc144209782de8c74fbd421c59c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "fall_Sun4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I miss my old truck driving job. I used to go all around the valley, meetin' people, listenin' to the radio.#$e#Times sure do change.",
      "translation": "Chybí mi má stará práce řidičky náklaďáku. Jezdila jsem po celém údolí, potkávala lidi, poslouchala rádio.#$e#Časy se ale mění.",
      "sourceSHA256": "1cdba505dceccdb7d060219f07beca996762d0bcc697a9da48f612c3e70e5505",
      "translationSHA256": "e651d0c4a0e599fbde35bde77444a7ec43e914b9202c83a02d69512705e5110a",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "winter_Mon",
      "field": null,
      "source": "You got any hogs on that farm?",
      "translation": "Chováš na té farmě nějaká prasata?",
      "sourceSHA256": "1482bd008e18b5bf2f197791be02aea3c90a5786350532b3ffa63dd1cf27b57b",
      "translationSHA256": "f48c8b1f9ef4066989a301b6a98468cc45947bc82382f7b63d65f8e7e44ef1aa",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "winter_Tue",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Do you want somethin' from me, kid? Best look somewhere else.",
      "translation": "Něco ode mě chceš, děcko? Radši hledej jinde.",
      "sourceSHA256": "6ed446988f2a8be15b2102c7f852924c807afd230358c55c757e97fcd34d3598",
      "translationSHA256": "55d7ab158eeb9123e1c53581f02396835240dca62e16a7b8b1860893cb30d779",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "winter_Tue4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I just hope Penny has a good life ahead of her. If you ever have kids you'll know how I feel.#$e#...It's so dry in winter. My skin feels like old parchment.",
      "translation": "Jen doufám, že má Penny před sebou hezký život. Až jednou budeš mít děti, pochopíš, jak mi je.#$e#... V zimě je tak sucho. Kůži mám jako starý pergamen.",
      "sourceSHA256": "e0f8ab83eae3e4513fb523bbaa579e150e3231451be9cd1667e751d4571a974f",
      "translationSHA256": "cbba074c7759256cba2a43336c4aabb8f249dc94622e594e5426e95d02c0d4e3",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "winter_Tue4_inlaw_Penny",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey. You better be treatin' Penny right on that old farm of yours. She's the only one I got!",
      "translation": "Hej. Na té své staré farmě se k Penny radši chovej dobře. Je jediná, koho mám!",
      "sourceSHA256": "7c247f26ffbb37867f84a88e186e7f355006ddca78c9e9e8b1872855ce01b64e",
      "translationSHA256": "ba8c5d5342c49973e195875775bf551ec5bd2ac8d50f1b3545f1c2e725b9ffd2",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "winter_Wed",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey kid. What're you up to?#$e#I'm just passin' time, same as always.",
      "translation": "Hej, děcko. Co děláš?#$e#Já si jen krátím čas, jako vždycky.",
      "sourceSHA256": "afcad22bdeed41cc414706d5b900eb3e83079b828126a9f19ab7b8804160c6be",
      "translationSHA256": "7847762367d05b1a14dc98c9579dedd309f83e4ae68db25257085129eb750b54",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "winter_Thu",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It's awful cold. A visit to the saloon should warm me up, don't you think? Heh heh.#$e#Why don't you swing by the saloon later for a taste o' the Oh-Be-Joyful?",
      "translation": "Je příšerná zima. Návštěva saloonu by mě měla zahřát, nemyslíš? Hehehe.#$e#Proč se tam později nestavíš ochutnat trochu veselé vodičky?",
      "sourceSHA256": "89794077fc4b468a164031761c1abaa69fa731d47c82543b85a2aa75abdd5e7e",
      "translationSHA256": "85fcaf9f8def8edf2a22e6416cbf5bee4af87b141f808b0f1c01b92ce7419153",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "winter_Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Penny sure does like old books. I think she's a heck of a lot smarter than I ever was.#$e#I'm glad.",
      "translation": "Penny má ty staré knihy vážně ráda. Myslím, že je mnohem chytřejší, než jsem kdy byla já.#$e#Mám radost.",
      "sourceSHA256": "eaa90db46860a201396a521c378353c5768d1634896c90f37b96075063b0a0bc",
      "translationSHA256": "dd4be98f3980f85377af24fbc3069791dfcdfd78c5d9adc7b6c327b0f5c7c1e6",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "winter_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I oughta take up fishin', seein' as how close the river is.",
      "translation": "Měla bych začít rybařit, když mám řeku tak blízko.",
      "sourceSHA256": "defdc12388b388bcbfd7cf299c3408473cc6a48f137f18ae5d5f0932547fbc75",
      "translationSHA256": "aaaab2d785e48920585ad38414c76b3c27720b09df1ea5ea5cd399e2b0b00606",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Pam",
      "key": "winter_Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Blah... my front yard's a mess.$s",
      "translation": "Blé... Mám před domem pěkný nepořádek.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "0072eeb473f89553a9d3200ef57ba8d349cfdb91c4a8a6e6f64957abafeef4d7",
      "translationSHA256": "0cc92ea248d2d195171f153e61af4ff16087a3f221e7bab6ff5ca14294b589be",
